        "description": "创建监测任务\n\nBytePlus Market Insight monitor operation. Requires an AIsa API key and owner-scoped TaskID for existing tasks. Only POST JSON on the canonical path is supported; URL query parameters, proxy aliases, MPP and cost quotes are rejected. Request validation is owned by the handler; provider-specific Config fields and PullPosts filters are forwarded. Existing V2 customer pricing applies.",
